	)
	(text "This converter supplies the 3.3 V I/O domain of MIRA's FPGA subsystem and its\nboard interfaces. The FPGA exchanges commands and data with the STM32 and\nmanages the fast matrix/ADC path. An independent I/O rail supports controlled\nstartup and monitoring alongside the auxiliary supplies."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 45.44 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f0c91f31-61de-4a19-93d4-5b23194bd652")
	)
	(text "R1503 (49.9 kOhm) and R1504 (16 kOhm) set the RAW voltage:\nV(IO33_RAW)=0.8 V x (1+R1503/R1504) = 3.295 V.\nTo change it: R1503 = R1504 x (VRAW / 0.8 V - 1). Increasing R1503 raises the\nvoltage. DEF is grounded; the +5% margin is disabled."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.55 1.55)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f6c6d933-76e9-45a9-abde-cbddb068bdba")
	)
